To baseline your Prisma migrations on the existing PostgreSQL database without losing data:

1. Create a baseline migration directory: `mkdir -p prisma/migrations/0_init`

2. Generate the baseline SQL: `npx prisma migrate diff --from-empty --to-schema-datamodel prisma/schema.prisma --script > prisma/migrations/0_init/migration.sql`

3. Create the migration lock file if absent: `echo 'provider = "postgresql"' > prisma/migrations/migration_lock.toml`

4. Mark the baseline as applied: `npx prisma migrate resolve --applied 0_init`

5. Verify status: `npx prisma migrate status`

You can now run `npx prisma migrate dev` for future changes.
